{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0051-n-queens","title":"LeetCode 51 N 皇后","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-backtracking-string/lc0051-n-queens","wordCount":874,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-51-n-皇后\">LeetCode 51 N 皇后</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>N 皇后问题要求在一个 n×n 的棋盘上放置 n 个皇后，使得任意两个皇后不能处于同一行、同一列或同一对角线上。给定整数 n，返回所有不同的 N 皇后问题的解决方案。</p>\n<p>每个解决方案包含一个 n×n 棋盘的放置方案，其中 <code>&#39;Q&#39;</code> 表示皇后，<code>&#39;.&#39;</code> 表示空位。</p>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：n = 4&#10;输出：[&#10;  [&quot;.Q..&quot;,&quot;...Q&quot;,&quot;Q...&quot;,&quot;..Q.&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;..Q.&quot;,&quot;Q...&quot;,&quot;...Q&quot;,&quot;.Q..&quot;]&#10;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：n = 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\".Q..\",\"...Q\",\"Q...\",\"..Q.\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"..Q.\",\"Q...\",\"...Q\",\".Q..\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= 9</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>N 皇后是回溯法的经典应用。核心观察是：每一行恰好放一个皇后，因此可以逐行放置，每行尝试不同的列位置。</p>\n<p><strong>冲突检测的关键在于对角线的处理。</strong> 对于位置 <code>(r, c)</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>主对角线（左上到右下）上所有格子的 <code>r - c</code> 值相同</li>\n<li>副对角线（右上到左下）上所有格子的 <code>r + c</code> 值相同</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此只需维护三个集合：已占用的列、已占用的主对角线、已占用的副对角线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逐行放置</td>\n<td>每行只放一个皇后</td>\n<td>天然保证行不冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列集合</td>\n<td>记录已占用的列号</td>\n<td>O(1) 判断列冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主对角线集合</td>\n<td>记录 r-c 值</td>\n<td>O(1) 判断主对角线冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副对角线集合</td>\n<td>记录 r+c 值</td>\n<td>O(1) 判断副对角线冲突</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>回溯流程：</strong> 从第 0 行开始，尝试在第 <code>r</code> 行的每一列 <code>c</code> 放置皇后。如果位置合法（列、两条对角线均无冲突），则将皇后放置于此，继续递归处理第 <code>r+1</code> 行。如果第 <code>r</code> 行所有列都不合法，则回退到上一行，尝试下一个列位置。当 <code>r === n</code> 时，说明 n 个皇后全部放置成功，记录当前方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function solveNQueens(n: number): string[][] {&#10;  const result: string[][] = [];&#10;  const queens: number[] = [];&#10;  const cols = new Set&lt;number&gt;();&#10;  const diag1 = new Set&lt;number&gt;();&#10;  const diag2 = new Set&lt;number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  function backtrack(row: number): void {&#10;    if (row === n) {&#10;      result.push(queens.map((c) =&gt; &#39;.&#39;.repeat(c) + &#39;Q&#39; + &#39;.&#39;.repeat(n - c - 1)));&#10;      return;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    for (let col = 0; col &lt; n; col++) {&#10;      if (cols.has(col) || diag1.has(row - col) || diag2.has(row + col)) {&#10;        continue;&#10;      }&#10;&#10;      queens.push(col);&#10;      cols.add(col);&#10;      diag1.add(row - col);&#10;      diag2.add(row + col);&#10;&#10;      backtrack(row + 1);&#10;&#10;      queens.pop();&#10;      cols.delete(col);&#10;      diag1.delete(row - col);&#10;      diag2.delete(row + col);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  backtrack(0);&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> solveNQueens</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> queens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cols</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> diag1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> diag2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> backtrack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">row</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(queens.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Q'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; col</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cols.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(col) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diag1.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diag2.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      queens.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(col);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      cols.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(col);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      diag1.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      diag2.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      backtrack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      queens.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      cols.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(col);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      diag1.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      diag2.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  backtrack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实现要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>queens</code> 数组</strong>：<code>queens[i]</code> 记录第 <code>i</code> 行皇后所在的列号，既用于回溯也用于最终构建棋盘字符串。</li>\n<li><strong>三个 Set</strong>：分别追踪已占用的列、主对角线（<code>row - col</code>）、副对角线（<code>row + col</code>）。使用 Set 而非数组保证 O(1) 的查询和删除。</li>\n<li><strong>构建结果</strong>：当所有行都放置完毕，通过 <code>queens</code> 数组构建字符串数组。每行字符串由列号前的 <code>.</code>、一个 <code>Q</code>、列号后的 <code>.</code> 拼接而成。</li>\n<li><strong>完全回溯</strong>：每次递归返回后，必须同时从 <code>queens</code> 弹出元素，并从三个 Set 中移除对应值，恢复到递归前的状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对于 n=8 的经典八皇后问题，总共有 92 种解法。搜索树虽然理论上有 n^n 个叶节点，但通过列和对角线的约束剪枝，实际访问的节点数远小于此。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>O(n!)</td>\n<td>第 1 行 n 种选择，第 2 行至多 n-1 种，…；实际因对角线约束更少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>递归栈深度 n，三个集合各最多 n 个元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解的数量</td>\n<td>指数级增长</td>\n<td>n=8 时 92 个，n=9 时 352 个</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际性能表现：n ≤ 9 时（题目约束），搜索空间极小，运行时间在毫秒级别。N 皇后问题的解的数量随 n 的增长呈指数级增长，但对于本题的约束范围来说，回溯法完全足够。</p>\n<p>该问题的核心价值在于训练对回溯框架的理解——如何定义状态、如何判断合法性、如何在递归前后维护和恢复状态。这些技巧可以直接迁移到数独、组合求和、全排列等回溯类问题中。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 51 N 皇后","id":"leetcode-51-n-皇后"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 37 解数独","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-backtracking-string/lc0037-sudoku-solver"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 52 N 皇后 II","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-backtracking-string/lc0052-n-queens-ii"}}